 CellLabel->"Out[2]= ",ExpressionUUID->"56fcebc3-262d-4a16-a320-d4523171affd"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
A ray is a shortest path that stops only because it must; a walk right round \
a cycle is not a shortest path at all.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"5393db6c-08e7-4386-817b-733979c30f2b"],

